    "chunk_text": "t hie \u00dea het he, Pilatus, swa don: het gan his men to. \u00dea forbr\u00e6con hie \u00feara twega scea\u00feena sceancan \u00fee mid Criste hangedon; hie begen \u00fea gita lifgende \u00dea hie \u00fea to Criste comon, \u00fea gesawon hie \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s for\u00fefered on \u00fe\u00e6re rode. For \u00feam ne br\u00e6con hie his ban, ac genam \u00feara cempena an & mid his spere his sidan wundode, & \u00fea \u00de\u00e6t tacnode h\u00e6lo middangeardes, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0urh his blod fulwihtw\u00e6ter gewyr\u00fean sceolde. & he sylf cw\u00e6\u00f0, sanctus Iohannes: \u00deas gewitnesse ic secge, efne swa ic hit minum eagum geseah. & ic wat \u00fe\u00e6t sio min gewitnes is so\u00f0, & ic hit for \u00feam eow secge \u00fe\u00e6t ic wille \u00fe\u00e6t ge hit so\u00f0 gelyfen. W\u00e6s \u00feis eal to \u00f0am geworden - \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fea his ban ne br\u00e6con & hie hine mid \u00fey spere in \u00fea sidan Swylce eft o\u00f0er gewrit cw\u00e6\u00f0: Uidebunt in quem transfixerunt, Hie besawon \u00fea in \u00feone \u00fee hie \u00dea w\u00e6s Ioseph haten sum man Arema\u00f0\u00f0ia \u00fe\u00e6re byrig. W\u00e6s welig man for worulde, & he w\u00e6s eac for Gode so\u00f0f\u00e6st & god. W\u00e6s he digolice Cristes h\u00e6lendes \u00feegn, & he elcor ne dorste for Iudea ege. \u00dea iode he to Pilate & b\u00e6d hine \u00fe\u00e6t he moste geniman \u00fe\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes lichoman & bebyrgan. \u00dea lyfde he, Pilatus, him \u00fe\u00e6t. \u00dea com \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6s",
